{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-11 04:05:06 UTC] [Agent: Codex] [Project: fix_read_recent_project_resolution] Started project to fix `read_recent`/`query_entries` project resolution (explicit `project` arg ignored / defaults to current repo project). | reasoning={\"how\": \"Create focused dev plan project, reproduce via code inspection + tests, then adjust tool handlers/storage lookup to honor request-level `project` parameter and fix header labeling; add regression tests.\", \"what\": \"Constraints: must not create replacement modules; must preserve tool contracts and session/project mode rules; fix should work even when no session project is configured if `project` parameter is provided.\", \"why\": \"User reports `read_recent(project=...)` shows entries from wrong project (e.g. scribe_mcp) and `query_entries(project=...)` returns none; this breaks cross-repo log access.\"}; task=fix project resolution; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/fix_read_recent_project_resolution/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-11T04:05:06.156332+00:00_cc99a2cf", "timestamp": "2026-01-11T04:05:06.156357+00:00"}
